    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Mulan mode pedang ganda itu tipis, bunuh cepet. Mode pedang berat lebih lambat, hindarin skill-nya pakai dash."
    },
